WEBVTT

00:00.350 --> 00:02.008
This is MarginMail.

00:02.008 --> 00:09.675
Your mail, your calendar and the people
you work with, in one window on your Mac.

00:10.350 --> 00:11.933
It notes what needs you.

00:11.933 --> 00:16.227
Imogen wants 30 minutes next
week, and the note says so.

00:17.350 --> 00:21.774
As you write, MarginMail underlines
days, files and promises.

00:21.774 --> 00:25.835
Mention a day with someone
to see when you're both free.

00:25.835 --> 00:28.954
Pick a time and it's
held on your calendar.

00:28.954 --> 00:33.832
Name a file to attach it, and
a promise becomes a reminder.

00:34.350 --> 00:36.400
Everyone you write to has a page:

00:36.400 --> 00:41.350
what you talked about, what you
promised, and the time where they are.

00:41.850 --> 00:45.141
Companies group themselves
by email domain.

00:45.850 --> 00:50.367
Open an invitation, and the
calendar turns to that day.

00:50.367 --> 00:52.503
Press A, M or D to answer.

00:52.503 --> 00:54.900
The email files itself.

00:55.350 --> 01:00.574
When you invite a few people, you see
their free and busy times side by side.

01:01.850 --> 01:05.454
Pull the calendar wider,
and one day becomes three.

01:06.350 --> 01:08.367
Then there's the Margins stack:

01:08.367 --> 01:11.099
only what needs you, beside your calendar.

01:11.099 --> 01:13.716
Every card says why it's there.

01:14.350 --> 01:17.104
Jot a few notes and press Write it.

01:17.104 --> 01:20.881
A draft appears, from
your notes and the thread.

01:20.881 --> 01:24.265
Anything new, like this
number, is flagged.

01:24.265 --> 01:27.400
You read it, then send it yourself.

01:27.850 --> 01:30.318
Turn a card over to see its email.

01:30.318 --> 01:35.900
Drag right for Done. Drag left, and
it waits at the back of the stack.

01:36.350 --> 01:40.477
When the stack is empty,
you get a quiet scene.

01:42.850 --> 01:44.923
There's no MarginMail server.

01:44.923 --> 01:49.283
Your mail goes between your Mac
and Google, and nowhere else.

01:49.283 --> 01:52.671
Nothing tracks you, and AI never sends.

01:54.350 --> 01:58.721
MarginMail. Give your inbox some margin.

01:58.721 --> 02:02.708
Join the beta at marginmail.ai.
